foliatest
------------------------------------------
This package provides series of tests for libfolia.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libfolia22-2.22-1bl2
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libicu76-76.1-2
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  libticcutils10-0.38-1bl2
  libxml2_2-2.13.9-3

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  autoconf-archive-2026.11.11-1
  automake-20261107-1
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libfolia-2.22-1bl2
  libfolia-devel-2.22-1bl2
  libicu-devel-76.1-2
  libticcutils-devel-0.38-1bl2
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  libxml2-devel-2.13.9-3
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/LanguageMachines/foliatest

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/LanguageMachines/foliatest/archive/refs/tags/v0.15.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack foliatest-0.15-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./foliatest-0.15-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/foliatest-0.15-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/foliatest-0.15-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(foliatest)
  /usr/bin/foliatest.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/foliatest.README
  /usr/share/doc/foliatest/AUTHORS
  /usr/share/doc/foliatest/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/foliatest/NEWS
  /usr/share/doc/foliatest/README
  /usr/share/doc/foliatest/README.md
  /usr/share/doc/foliatest/TODO

